GDk9 Standard Governance Clause

The GDk9 Core Standard, Grammar Specification, IME Model, Reduction Contract,
and Conformance Specification (collectively "GDk9 Standards") are governed
separately from the software implementation.

The GDk9 Enhancement Proposal (GDk9-EP) process is the canonical governance
path for changes that claim to update GDk9 standards.

Forks of this repository may modify implementation code (KeySuite), but MUST NOT
represent altered behavior or altered standards as GDk9-compliant unless the
changes adhere to the published specifications for the version claimed.

